 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "adreview.governor (an independent Ad-Review Compliance Governor) in
 front of a contained adreview.adreviewllm advisor, wired as a
 langgraph StateGraph (adreview.operation) with an
 interrupt-before approval node. The flagship HARD check is
 ad-review-approval-missing: a campaign whose own product category is
 inside the jurisdiction's CLOSED reviewed set (广告法第四十六条's
 医疗/药品/医疗器械/农药/兽药/保健食品 plus 互联网广告管理办法第七条's
 特殊医学用途配方食品) may not be proposed for publication unless a
 广告批准文号 is independently verified as recorded AND unexpired at the
 campaign's own publish date (暂行办法第九条/第十八条). An unrecorded or
 non-ISO-8601 date pair yields ad-review-validity-unknown -- un-checkable
 is NOT 'still valid'. Four further China-specific HARD checks:
 internet-ad-unlabelled and popup-no-one-click-close
 (互联网广告管理办法第九条/第十条), endorser-did-not-use-product and
 endorser-under-minimum-age (广告法第三十八条). Plus the fleet's
 MAXIMUM-ceiling family check on media spend vs client-authorized
 budget, with its own explicit un-checkable hold, and double-actuation
 guards on review submission and publication. :review/submit and
 :campaign/publish are absent from every phase's :auto set, asserted at
 load time in adreview.phase."}
